{{also|Mulligan}}
==English==
{{wikipedia|lang=en|Mulligan (games)}}

===Etymology===
Attested since the 1930s in the sense “chance to re-take a golf stroke”; probably from the name {{m|en|Mulligan}}, after a golfer who replayed a stroke. See [[w:Mulligan (games)#Origin|Wikipedia]] for more information.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈmʌlɪɡən/}}

